Z||000000||yo_sweet||11-29-2001||10:26 PM||||I have a tranny froma  3.1 grand prix it's an auto with OVER DRIVE will it bolt up and work correcly with my fiero 2.8? what complications will i run into?<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>1986 Fiero SE 2.8lv6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dance.gif">  <P><BR>www.geocities.com/acme_s2000/intro.html<BR>yo_sweet!||||reg||1
