Z||000002||Mach10||11-30-2001||12:07 AM||||If it's the 4t40 or 4t60 VACUUM controlled units, then they'll work. BUT you'll need the half-axle from a Pontiac 6000 to make it fit, and you'll need to SLOT the mounting holes in the cradle... After that, it's up to you to adjust the shift cable to get the extra ratio... Try searching the archives... All of it should be there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||yo_sweet||11-30-2001||12:15 AM||||thanks for the info , the grand prix was a 1990||||reg||1
Z||000004||RedHaze86SD4||11-30-2001||12:01 PM||||I'm probably wrong on this but I think the 90 is a vacuum, I've got a 91 grand am with 4spd auto and a 2.5 and the damn thing is comp controlled -=grrr=- I'm having fun converting my project fiero right now.. its not doing as well as I'd like  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||MinnGreenGT||11-30-2001||12:31 PM||||I have the 440t4 auto/OD tranny (mine's from an '88 Olds... I think).  Search tech section for info on the 440 swap- Pherder and I were discussing a few minor points a few months back.  <P>You'll need to modify the tranny mount slightly, as mentioned above- the axel issue (BTW: The 6000 axel <B>did not</B> fit my setup... I had one custom cut), and you'll have to T into the vacuum system (I spliced/attached mine near the EGR valve).  Then you'll have to spend a little time adjusting the shift point angle/location on the tranny (having an adjustable shifter cable will ease this greatly).  When finished you should be able to hit all the gears (you won't be able to "see" 1st, but you should be able to lock it in).  And finally, you'll need to rewire the TCC plug (I stil haven't done this, so mine will shift into 4th, but the TCC won't lock up).  It's really not too bad, just a little time & patience like any major swap.<P>Even without the TCC lockup, I cruise at about 3000rpm @ approx 95-100mph  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
